    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-act8">
        <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_1@4-6">In illa die.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e113">Qua Stephanus occisus est, non quia tunc solum facta, sed quia ab illa die coepit persecutio magna, occiso uno de principibus Ecclesiae.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_1@10-10">Ecclesia.</quote>
            Collectio vel congregatio, sive vocatio.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_1@16-17">Dispersi sunt.</quote>
            Hoc est quod Dominus praecepit: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e127" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt10_23@1-10">Cum <pb ed="#P" n="0445C"/> persequentur vos in civitate ista, fugite in aliam</quote>. Ejus enim nutu gerebatur: ut occasione tribulationis fieret seminarium Evangelii.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e136">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e138">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e140" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_2@1-5">Curaverunt autem Stephanum viri timorati,</quote>
            id est, Deum timentes, sive Christiani, qui postea sunt dispersi, sive Judaei timentes Deum etsi nondum Christiani.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e145">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e147">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e149">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e151" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_3@1-1">Saulus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e154"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e155" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e158">A Saule persecutore qui rex Israel fuit de tribu Benjamin, de qua et Paulus; etenim juxta antiquorum consuetudinem a majoribus posteri nomina trahunt.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e161">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e163" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_3@3-3">Devastabat.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e166"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e167" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e170">Quasi lupus gregem, juxta prophetiam Jacob: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e172" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen49_27@1-10">Benjamin lupus rapax mane comedet praedam, sero dividet spolia</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e177">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e179" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_3@9-9">Trahens.</quote>
            Trahebat, non occidebat, quia fortasse manus ejus custodiebat Dominus, ne sanguine innocentum polluerentur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e186">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_4@3-3">Dispersi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e193"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e194" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e197">Quamvis timore dispersi, tamen stabiles erant in praedicatione Evangelii.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e204">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_5@1-1">Philippus.</quote>
            De numero disseminatorum fuit, qui primus Christum praedicavit Samariae. Diaconus secundus a Stephano. Secundus post ipsum narratur quasi haeres et ejusdem gradus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e215">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_6@1-1">Intendebant.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e222"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e223" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e226">Credebant audientes verba, et videntes signa. Duae causae fidei: Verba praedicationis, et signa virtutum. Ex praesenti capitulo et samaritanae mulieris historia probatur animos hujus gentis ad credendum promptos fuisse, ait Beda.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e230">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e232">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e234">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0446A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e238" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_11@8-8">Magis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e241"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e242" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e245">Magi de singulis philosophantur, de natura mundi, cursu siderum, et motibus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e248">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e250" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_11">Seducens.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Seorsum et a veritate ducens, vel in excessum, sive stuporem et admirationem convertens, per praestigias suas.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e256">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e258" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_11@10-10">Dementasset.</quote>
            Dementare est rationalem mentem absentare.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e263">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e265">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e267">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e269" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_12@4-4">Philippo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e272"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e273" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e276">Dicunt quidam istum Philippum fuisse apostolum, et unum de duodecim, sed non videtur verum secundum seriem hujus libri.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e279">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e281" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_12@11-12">Jesu Christi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e284"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e285" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e288">Cujus erant ignari vel (ut praedictum est) in nomine Jesu Trinitatem praedicavit, et qui tantum unam personam de Trinitate perfecte credit, credulitate aliarum duarum carere non potest.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e292">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e294">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e296">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0446B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e300" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_13@1-2">Tunc Simon.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e303"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e304" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e307"><seg type="qs">Vel credidit Domino, verbis Philippi et virtute</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Ecclesiam fraudulenter ingressi, baptisma furantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e316">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e318">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e320">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e322" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_14@13-13">Miserunt.</quote>
            Petrus Joannem sociat sibi, quia virginitas Ecclesiae grata est, et placet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e328">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e330">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e332">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e334" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_16@11-12">In nomine.</quote>
            Non est sic legendum, <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e337" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_16@11-14">in nomine Jesu tantum,</quote> ut aliae personae excludantur, sed sic: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e340" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_16@9-10">tantum baptizati erant,</quote> etc., id est necdum confirmati.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e344">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e346" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_16@14-14">Jesu.</quote>
            Tamen ante, in Patrem credeban et in Spiritum sanctum, sicut alii Judaei. Vel, plena fides unius personae fidem Trinitatis confirmat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e351">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e353">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e355">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e357" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_17@2-3">Imponebant manus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e360"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e361" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e364"><seg type="qs">Philippus, qui Samariae evangelizabat, unus de septem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cum tradit Spiritum paracletum baptizatis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e373">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e375">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e377">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e379" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_19@6-6">Potestatem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e382"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e383" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e386">Non baptizandi <pb ed="#P" n="0446C"/> tantum in aqua et praedicandi, sive virtutes faciendi quam habebat Philippus, sed cuicunque imponendi manus, etc.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e393">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e395">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e397">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e399" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_20@1-2">Pecunia tua.</quote>
            Non nostra, qui non cupimus, sed <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e402" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_20@2-2">tua,</quote> quam Spiritui comparas, ut illam pro eo vendas, et illam Spiritu emas. Ideo Spiritum emere volebat, ut aliis vendens eum, plus accipere posset.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e406">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e408" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_20@1-1">Pecunia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e411"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e412" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e415">Ex hoc exemplum capitur, ut perditorum eleemosyna non recipiatur.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e418">
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e420" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/act8_20@1-1"/>
            Apostoli nolentes pecuniam, dicunt, <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e422">sit tecum,</quote> id est tuam retine, et hoc, in perditionem, ut, pecunia injuste congregata, poenam aeternam luas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e426">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e428">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e430">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e432" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_22@1-3">Poenitentiam age.</quote>
            Pro cupiditate, et pravo sensu quo putasti de Spiritu commercium <pb ed="#P" n="0446D"/> fieri posse.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e438">
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e440" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/act8_22@1-3"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e442"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e443" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e446">Ut omnes videant id quod es. Non quod ignoret Petrus eum poenitentiam non acturum, sed quia omnibus justum est praedicare, suum facit officium, ut ille sit inexcusabilis. Coram omnibus etiam arguitur ne amplius ab eo fallantur.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e449">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e451" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_22@9-10">Roga Deum.</quote>
            Cui patet cor, de quo Propheta: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e454" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps72_1@3-6">Quam bonus Israel Deus</quote>; quem fallere nemo potest, quia <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e457" source="http://scta.info/resource/sap1_5@3-6">Spiritus sanctus disciplinae effugiet fictum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e462">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e464">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e466">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e468" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_24@5-5">Precamini.</quote>
            Causa desperationis non audet ipse precari, sed apostolos rogat, ut pro se precentur, nec pro se audet orare, qui non credit se exaudiendum esse. Apostolis etiam ficte loquitur. <pb ed="#P" n="0447A"/>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e474">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e476" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_24@17-18">Quae dixistis.</quote>
            Non quae credidi, sed quasi infidelis eis imputat quae ventura sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e482">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e484">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e486">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e488" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_26@1-2">Angelus autem.</quote>
            Post reditum apostolorum, de Philippo historia texitur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e492">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e494" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_26@14-15">Ad viam,</quote>
            etc. Nam via descendit, et per viam descenditur ex natura loci.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e499">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e501">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e503">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e505" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_27@7-7">Aethiops.</quote>
            Natura et merito. Aethiops enim tenebrosus. Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e508" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps67_32@6-10">Aethiopia praeveniet manus ejus Deo</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e512">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e514" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_27@9-9">Potens,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e517"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e518" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e521">Regina Aethiopum thesaurarium praemittens, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e523" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps44_11@1-8">usque ad, Audi, filia, et vide et inclina aurem tuam</quote>, etc.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e528">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e530" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_27@10-11">Candacis reginae.</quote>
            Mos erat illius regionis a feminis regi, et eas Candaces vocari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e535">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e537">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e539">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e541" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_28@2-2">Revertebatur.</quote>
            Incipiebat reverti legens <pb ed="#P" n="0447B"/> Isaiam. Ubicunque in Novo Testamento salutis narratur principium, de Isaia sumitur testimonium, qui interpretatur <mentioned>salus Domini</mentioned>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e550">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e552">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e554">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e556" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_30@11-12">Putasne intelligis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e559"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e560" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e563">Suas invicem linguas agnoscunt, vel per doctrinam eunuchi vel per spiritum Philippi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e567">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e569">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e571">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e573" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_31@4-4">Quomodo,</quote>
            etc. Hic arguit illorum audaciam qui existimant sine doctore Scripturam divinam intelligere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e578">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e580">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e582">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e584" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_33@1-2">In humilitate.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e587"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e588" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e591">Etenim judex omnium, veritatem judicii non reperit, sed sine ulla sua culpa, seditione Judaeorum, et voce Pilati, damnatus est.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e594">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e596" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_33@2-2">Humilitate.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e599"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e600" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e603">Passione qua <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e605" source="http://scta.info/resource/phil2_8@1-8">humiliavit se factus obediens usque ad mortem</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e610">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0447C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e614" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_33@12-12">Tolletur.</quote>
            Secundus homo de coelo coelestis, sanctitate segregatus a terrenis, vel, de vita in mortem transibit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e620">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e622">Versus 35</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e624">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e626" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_35">Aperuit.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e631"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e632" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e635">Thesaurum scientiae aperuit. Vel aperuit os, ut Spiritus loquatur in eo, secundum illud: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e637" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps80_11@13-18">Dilata os tuum, et implebo illud</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e642">
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e644" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/act8_35"/>
            Mystice, os Ecclesiae Philippus aperuit, ut ex hoc Gentibus is praedicetur quem prius nesciebant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e647">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e649" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_35@11-11">Evangelizavit.</quote>
            Solvit quaestionem illius interrogantis: <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e652" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_34@8-11">De quo propheta dixit?</quote> Demonstrat autem quod de Jesu prophetatum est.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e657">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e659">Versus 36</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e661">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e663" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_36@7-9">Ad quamdam aquam.</quote>
            Ad hoc enim praedicatio duxerat, ut aqua indigeret, quae de baptismo in via audierat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e668">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e670">Versus 37</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e672">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0447D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e676" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_37@4-5">Si credis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e679"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e680" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e683">Non ignorabat ejus fidem, sed volebat manifestam confessionem, ut baptizaturis et baptizandis daretur exemplum interrogandi et confitendi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e687">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e689">Versus 39</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e691">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e693" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_39@6-7">Spiritus Domini.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e696"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e697" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e700"><seg type="qs">Vel Spiritus irruit in eum fortiter, sicut et in apostolos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">in quos Spiritus descenderat?</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act8-Dd1e709">
          <head xml:id="gom-act8-Hd1e711">Versus 40</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e713">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e715" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_40@3-4">Inventus est.</quote>
            Ab hominibus qui in raptu non inveniebatur, quia ambulavit in solitudine, vel nimia velocitate.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act8-d1e719">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e721" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act8_40@14-14">Caesaream.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act8-Rd1e724"><name xml:id="gom-act8-Nd1e725" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act8-Qd1e728">Caesaream Palaestinae dicit ubi infra domum habuisse describitur, quae usque hodie demonstratur, necnon et cubiculum filiarum quatuor ejus prophetantium virginum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
